/t64.5771-25/491827646_1761626937830629_7829002067608260664_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GdsHP86_Z9wQ7kNvwFOoD0H&_nc_oc=AdqdVDHwKQE4UWGS9LVHIVpBFHKmjZPzDsA2Q4tREfRHwgwP_-MjHinKNzpY1lLFbl0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKiuLFPqjAdH2BzgXCDQJZ6h4hFmt0oNnxN2v_XGWQMPg&oe=6AA025B4"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_5.png", "id": "1835436877101081", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823812_1835436880434414_2753263375629477104_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HEAcU2ONc3gQ7kNvwFpHUru&_nc_oc=Adp3YWGYjTeN66JrWzHLEWR5yFNLob69HlK19aPuQ7p-eN9YuyyCsjE_KZAiW3vMNbU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLAbnkHKXIARI1DK79B_PWMK4ljviEZEdoBKLiHkwLGHA&oe=6AA02376"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Parkour Labs", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to the Ultimate Parkour Game!\n\nWelcome to Parkour Labs, a vaporwave-inspired parkour game.\nSurf the waves of nostalgia and retro aesthetics, sliding down ramps and performing smooth turns.\nExplore colorful and surreal landscapes inspired by the culture, music, and art of the 80s and 90s.\nCollect glitch effects and artifacts to unlock new levels and secrets.\nExperience the synthwave atmosphere in this unique and original game that challenges your mouse control and movement skills.", "short_description": "Think you're a parkour master? Prove it!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2216906595381772", "locale": "zh_HK", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Parkour Labs", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u6b61\u8fce\u4f86\u5230\u7d42\u6975\u8dd1\u9177\u904a\u6232\uff01\n\n\u6b61\u8fce\u4f86\u5230 Parkour Labs\uff0c\u4e00\u6b3e\u53d7 vaporwave \u555f\u767c\u7684\u8dd1\u9177\u904a\u6232\u3002\n\u5728\u61f7\u820a\u548c\u5fa9\u53e4\u7f8e\u5b78\u7684\u6d6a\u6f6e\u4e2d\u885d\u6d6a\uff0c\u6ed1\u4e0b\u5761\u9053\u4e26\u9806\u66a2\u8f49\u5411\u3002\n\u63a2\u7d22\u53d780\u5e74\u4ee3\u548c90\u5e74\u4ee3\u6587\u5316\u3001\u97f3\u6a02\u8207\u85dd\u8853\u555f\u767c\u7684\u7e7d\u7d1b\u8d85\u73fe\u5be6\u666f\u89c0\u3002\n\u6536\u96c6\u6545\u969c\u7279\u6548\u548c\u5176\u4ed6\u9053\u5177\uff0c\u89e3\u9396\u65b0\u95dc\u5361\u548c\u79d8\u5bc6\u3002\n\u5728\u9019\u6b3e\u7368\u7279\u4e14\u539f\u5275\u7684\u904a\u6232\u4e2d\u9ad4\u9a57\u5408\u6210\u6ce2\u6c1b\u570d\uff0c\u6311\u6230\u4f60\u7684\u6ed1\u9f20\u64cd\u63a7\u8207\u79fb\u52d5\u6280\u5de7\u3002", "short_description": "\u81ea\u8a8d\u662f\u8dd1\u9177\u9ad8\u624b\uff1f\u4f86\u8b49\u660e\u5427\uff01"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1965435394103250", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Parkour Labs", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u00a1Bienvenido al juego definitivo de parkour!\n\nBienvenido a Parkour Labs, un juego de parkour inspirado en el vaporwave.\nSurfea las olas de la nostalgia y la est\u00e9tica retro, desliz\u00e1ndote por rampas y realizando giros fluidos.\nExplora paisajes coloridos y surrealistas inspirados en la cultura, la m\u00fasica y el arte de los a\u00f1os 80 y 90.\nRecoge efectos de glitch y otros artefactos para desbloquear nuevos niveles y secretos.\nDisfruta de la atm\u00f3sfera synthwave en este juego \u00fanico y original que pondr\u00e1 a prueba tu control del rat\u00f3n y tus habilidades de movimiento.", "short_description": "\u00bfCrees que eres un maestro del parkour? \u00a1Dem\u00faestralo!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1650027269323994", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Parkour Labs", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Willkommen bei Parkour Labs, einem vom Vaporwave inspirierten Parkour-Spiel.\nReite auf den Wellen der Nostalgie und Retro-\u00c4sthetik, gleite \u00fcber Rampen und f\u00fchre sanfte Drehungen aus.\nErkunde bunte und surreale Landschaften, inspiriert von der Kultur, Musik und Kunst der 80er und 90er Jahre.\nSammle Glitch-Effekte und Artefakte, um neue Levels und Geheimnisse freizuschalten.\nErlebe die Synthwave-Atmosph\u00e4re in diesem einzigartigen und originellen Spiel, das deine Mausbeherrschung und Bewegungsskills herausfordert.", "short_description": "Glaubst du, du bist ein Parkour-Meister? Beweise es!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1467530121686987", "locale": "pt_PT", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Parkour Labs", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Bem-vindo ao jogo definitivo de parkour!\n\nBem-vindo ao Parkour Labs, um jogo de parkour inspirado no vaporwave.\nSurfe nas ondas da nostalgia e da est\u00e9tica retr\u00f4, deslizando por rampas e fazendo curvas suaves.\nExplore cen\u00e1rios coloridos e surreais inspirados na cultura, m\u00fasica e arte dos anos 80 e 90.\nColete efeitos de glitch e artefatos para desbloquear novos n\u00edveis e segredos.\nSinta a atmosfera synthwave neste jogo \u00fanico e original que desafia seu controle do mouse e suas habilidades de movimento.", "short_description": "Acha que \u00e9 mestre do parkour? Prove isso!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1456519322632744", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Parkour Labs", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u7a76\u6975\u306e\u30d1\u30eb\u30af\u30fc\u30eb\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3078\u3088\u3046\u3053\u305d\uff01\n\n\u30d9\u30a4\u30d1\u30fc\u30a6\u30a7\u30a4\u30d6\u306b\u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30d1\u30a4\u30a2\u3055\u308c\u305f\u30d1\u30eb\u30af\u30fc\u30eb\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3001Parkour Labs\u3078\u3088\u3046\u3053\u305d\u3002\n\u61d0\u304b\u3057\u3055\u3068\u30ec\u30c8\u30ed\u306a\u7f8e\u5b66\u306e\u6ce2\u306b\u4e57\u308a\u3001\u30e9\u30f3\u30d7\u3092\u6ed1\u308a\u306a\u304c\u3089\u30b9\u30e0\u30fc\u30ba\u306b\u30bf\u30fc\u30f3\u3092\u6c7a\u3081\u3088\u3046\u3002\n80\u301c90\u5e74\u4ee3\u306e\u6587\u5316\u3001\u97f3\u697d\u3001\u82b8\u8853\u306b\u5f71\u97ff\u3092\u53d7\u3051\u305f\u30ab\u30e9\u30d5\u30eb\u3067\u5e7b\u60f3\u7684\u306a\u98a8\u666f\u3092\u63a2\u7d22\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3002\n\u30b0\u30ea\u30c3\u30c1\u52b9\u679c\u3084\u30a2\u30fc\u30c6\u30a3\u30d5\u30a1\u30af\u30c8\u3092\u96c6\u3081\u3066\u65b0\u3057\u3044\u30ec\u30d9\u30eb\u3084\u79d8\u5bc6\u3092\u30a2\u30f3\u30ed\u30c3\u30af\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3002\n\u3053\u306e\u30e6\u30cb\u30fc\u30af\u3067\u30aa\u30ea\u30b8\u30ca\u30eb\u306a\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3067\u3001\u30de\u30a6\u30b9\u64cd\u4f5c\u3068\u52d5\u304d\u306e\u30b9\u30ad\u30eb\u306b\u6311\u6226\u3057\u3001\u30b7\u30f3\u30bb\u30a6\u30a7\u30fc\u30d6\u306e\u4e16\u754c\u3092\u4f53\u9a13\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3002", "short_description": "\u81ea\u5206\u304c\u30d1\u30eb\u30af\u30fc\u30eb\u306e\u9054\u4eba\u3060\u3068\u601d\u3046\uff1f\u8a3c\u660e\u3057\u3066\u307f\u308d\uff01"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1452487942834125", "locale": "it_IT", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Parkour Labs", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Benvenuto nel gioco di parkour definitivo!\n\nBenvenuto in Parkour Labs, un gioco di parkour ispirato al vaporwave.\nSfreccia sulle onde della nostalgia e dell'estetica retr\u00f2, scivolando sulle rampe e compiendo curve fluide.\nEsplora paesaggi colorati e surreali ispirati alla cultura, musica e arte degli anni '80 e '90.\nRaccogli effetti glitch e altri artefatti per sbloccare nuovi livelli e segreti.\nVivi l'atmosfera synthwave in questo gioco unico e originale che metter\u00e0 alla prova il tuo controllo del mouse e le tue abilit\u00e0 di movimento.", "short_description": "Ti credi un maestro del parkour? Dimostralo!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1297424982227387", "locale": "zh_CN", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Parkour Labs", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u6b22\u8fce\u6765\u5230\u7ec8\u6781\u8dd1\u9177\u6e38\u620f\uff01\n\n\u6b22\u8fce\u6765\u5230 Parkour Labs\uff0c\u4e00\u6b3e\u53d7\u84b8\u6c7d\u6ce2\u98ce\u683c\u542f\u53d1\u7684\u8dd1\u9177\u6e38\u620f\u3002\n\u5728\u6000\u65e7\u4e0e\u590d\u53e4\u7f8e\u5b66\u7684\u6ce2\u6d6a\u4e2d\u51b2\u6d6a\uff0c\u6ed1\u4e0b\u5761\u9053\u5e76\u5b8c\u6210\u6d41\u7545\u8f6c\u5f2f\u3002\n\u63a2\u7d22\u53d780\u548c90\u5e74\u4ee3\u6587\u5316\u3001\u97f3\u4e50\u4e0e\u827a\u672f\u542f\u53d1\u7684\u591a\u5f69\u800c\u8d85\u73b0\u5b9e\u7684\u666f\u89c2\u3002\n\u6536\u96c6\u6545\u969c\u7279\u6548\u548c\u5176\u4ed6\u7269\u54c1\u4ee5\u89e3\u9501\u65b0\u5173\u5361\u548c\u79d8\u5bc6\u3002\n\u5728\u8fd9\u6b3e\u72ec\u7279\u4e14\u539f\u521b\u7684\u6e38\u620f\u4e2d\u4f53\u9a8c\u5408\u6210\u6ce2\u6c1b\u56f4\uff0c\u6311\u6218\u4f60\u7684\u9f20\u6807\u63a7\u5236\u548c\u52a8\u4f5c\u6280\u5de7\u3002\n", "short_description": "\u81ea\u8ba4\u662f\u8dd1\u9177\u5927\u5e08\uff1f\u6765\u8bc1\u660e\u5427\uff01"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1246220820960776", "locale": "ko_KR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Parkour Labs", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\uad81\uadf9\uc758 \ud30c\ucfe0\ub974 \uac8c\uc784\uc5d0 \uc624\uc2e0 \uac83\uc744 \ud658\uc601\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4!\n\nParkour Labs\uc5d0 \uc624\uc2e0 \uac83\uc744 \ud658\uc601\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4, \ubca0\uc774\ud37c\uc6e8\uc774\ube0c\uc5d0\uc11c \uc601\uac10\uc744 \ubc1b\uc740 \ud30c\ucfe0\ub974 \uac8c\uc784\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\ud5a5\uc218\ub97c \ubd88\ub7ec\uc77c\uc73c\ud0a4\ub294 \ub808\ud2b8\ub85c \ubbf8\ud559\uc758 \ud30c\ub3c4\ub97c \ud0c0\uba70 \ub7a8\ud504\ub97c \ubbf8\ub044\ub7ec\uc9c0\uace0 \ubd80\ub4dc\ub7fd\uac8c \ubc29\ud5a5\uc744 \uc804\ud658\ud558\uc138\uc694.\n80\ub144\ub300\uc640 90\ub144\ub300\uc758 \ubb38\ud654, \uc74c\uc545, \uc608\uc220\uc5d0\uc11c \uc601\uac10\uc744 \ubc1b\uc740 \ub2e4\ucc44\ub86d\uace0 \ucd08\ud604\uc2e4\uc801\uc778 \ud48d\uacbd\uc744 \ud0d0\ud5d8\ud558\uc138\uc694.\n\uc0c8\ub85c\uc6b4 \ub808\ubca8\uacfc \ube44\ubc00\uc744 \uc5f4\uae30 \uc704\ud574 \uae00\ub9ac\uce58 \ud6a8\uacfc\uc640 \uc544\ud2f0\ud329\ud2b8\ub97c \uc218\uc9d1\ud558\uc138\uc694.\n\uc774 \ub3c5\ud2b9\ud558\uace0 \ucc3d\uc758\uc801\uc778 \uac8c\uc784\uc5d0\uc11c \ub9c8\uc6b0\uc2a4 \uc81c\uc5b4\uc640 \uc774\ub3d9 \uae30\uc220\uc744 \uc2dc\ud5d8\ud558\uba70 \uc2e0\uc2a4\uc6e8\uc774\ube0c \ubd84\uc704\uae30\ub97c \uacbd\ud5d8\ud558\uc138\uc694.", "short_description": "\ub108 \uc790\uc2e0\uc774 \ud30c\ucfe0\ub974 \ub9c8\uc2a4\ud130\ub77c\uace0 \uc0dd\uac01\ud574? \uc99d\uba85\ud574\ubd10!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "947165717885785", "locale": "zh_TW", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Parkour Labs", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u6b61\u8fce\u4f86\u5230 Parkour Labs\uff0c\u4e00\u6b3e\u53d7 vaporwave \u555f\u767c\u7684\u8dd1\u9177\u904a\u6232\u3002\n\u5728\u61f7\u820a\u548c\u5fa9\u53e4\u7f8e\u5b78\u7684\u6d6a\u6f6e\u4e2d\u885d\u6d6a\uff0c\u6ed1\u4e0b\u5761\u9053\u4e26\u9806\u66a2\u8f49\u5411\u3002\n\u63a2\u7d22\u53d780\u5e74\u4ee3\u548c90\u5e74\u4ee3\u6587\u5316\u3001\u97f3\u6a02\u8207\u85dd\u8853\u555f\u767c\u7684\u7e7d\u7d1b\u8d85\u73fe\u5be6\u666f\u89c0\u3002\n\u6536\u96c6\u6545\u969c\u7279\u6548\u548c\u5176\u4ed6\u9053\u5177\uff0c\u89e3\u9396\u65b0\u95dc\u5361\u548c\u79d8\u5bc6\u3002\n\u5728\u9019\u6b3e\u7368\u7279\u4e14\u539f\u5275\u7684\u904a\u6232\u4e2d\u9ad4\u9a57\u5408\u6210\u6ce2\u6c1b\u570d\uff0c\u6311\u6230\u4f60\u7684\u6ed1\u9f20\u64cd\u63a7\u8207\u79fb\u52d5\u6280\u5de7\u3002", "short_description": "\u81ea\u8a8d\u662f\u8dd1\u9177\u9ad8\u624b\uff1f\u4f86\u8b49\u660e\u5427\uff01"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "943629901925710", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Parkour Labs", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Bienvenue dans l'ultime jeu de parkour !\n\nBienvenue dans Parkour Labs, un jeu de parkour inspir\u00e9 du vaporwave.\nSurfez sur les vagues de nostalgie et d'esth\u00e9tique r\u00e9tro, glissez sur des rampes et r\u00e9alisez des virages fluides.\nExplorez des paysages color\u00e9s et surr\u00e9alistes inspir\u00e9s de la culture, de la musique et de l'art des ann\u00e9es 80 et 90.\nCollectez des effets de glitch et d'autres artefacts pour d\u00e9bloquer de nouveaux niveaux et secrets.\nPlongez dans l'ambiance synthwave de ce jeu unique et original qui mettra \u00e0 l'\u00e9preuve votre contr\u00f4le de la souris et vos comp\u00e9tences de mouvement.", "short_description": "Tu te crois ma\u00eetre du parkour ? Prouve-le !"}]}, "developer_name": "SoyKhaler", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://soykhaler.github.io/policy-privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Pdpartidagames", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.pdpartida.es/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "27077992345135545"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823905_2358135471312951_3324998182586134185_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uJG3kf6e_i8Q7kNvwGHSRNZ&_nc_oc=Adr57ZuNfwzJFa-fF_n7pl874px3UGAMz097kJdxOrorsJ41gF62AharK56_NeuufBw&_nc_z